CCAAVVEEAATTSS
     The trunk protocols llooaaddbbaallaannccee and rroouunnddrroobbiinn require a switch which
     supports IEEE 802.3ad static link aggregation; otherwise protocols such
     as inet6(4) duplicate address detection (DAD) cannot properly deal with
     duplicate packets.

     The ttrruunnkk interface takes its MTU from the first ttrruunnkkppoorrtt.  To avoid
     mismatches, adding a child interface with a different MTU is not permit‐
     ted.

